SHW09_vtol mixer
- group 0: motor/throttle only.
- group 1: body-frame surface moments [roll, pitch, yaw].
- Tailsitter with VT_TS_DF_CTRL=1 maps MC controls or FW controls into group 1.
- In FW mode, FW roll is converted to body yaw in tailsitter.cpp.
===========================

thrust is range from 0 to 1,
This mixer generates a full-range output (-1 to 1) from an input in the (0 - 1)
range. Inputs below zero are treated as zero.

# Virtual actuator types for mixer_outputs_value:
# V: <global_output_slot> <type>, type 0 servo/control surface, 1 motor.
V: 0 1
V: 4 0
